Files: third_party/pjproject/*
Copyright: 2008-2024 Teluu Inc.
License: GPL-2+
Comment: pjproject is vendored as a pinned submodule and linked
 statically into libcomlink_core.so, so the shipped library contains
 pjproject code. It is not repackaged as a separate binary package
 because Debian ships no pjproject at a matching version, and both
 supported platforms must build from one pinned revision.
 .
 pjproject is available under GPLv2-or-later or a commercial licence
 from Teluu. This package takes the GPL option, under its "or later"
 clause, so the combined work is distributed under GPL-3+. Whoever
 distributes it carries those obligations, including offering its
 source.

Files: third_party/fonts/dejavu/*
Copyright: 2003 Bitstream, Inc.; DejaVu changes are in the public domain
License: bitstream-vera
Comment: Bundled into the Android package only, so the handset draws in
 the face the desktop gets from fontconfig. The full notice, including
 the Arev additions, is third_party/fonts/dejavu/LICENSE, copied from
 Debian's fonts-dejavu-core.

